    - The handler reads token and query id, fetches the XML and appends one Report. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-ibkr/src/operations/sync-portfolio.ts
    - The feed is found by IBKR_FEED_KIND or created. github:dxos/dxos/packages/plugins/plugin-ibkr/src/operations/feed.ts#getOrCreatePortfolioFeed
  note: |
    A missing credential fails with `IbkrConnectionError`; `RateLimited` and `FetchFailed` both become `IbkrSyncError`
    with the original message. A feed created here is a standalone `Feed`, not one owned by a `Portfolio`.
```

